    <node id="&quot;字符串外串&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"字符串外串 is a programming problem where participants must determine if a string of length n exists with a specific 'cute degree' of m, as defined by 牛可乐."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 is the name of the programming problem that involves calculating the 'cute degree' of strings and determining the existence of valid strings."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 is the problem where the '可爱度' of a string is determined based on specific substring and subsequence conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 is the programming problem where participants must determine if a string of length n exists with a '可爱度' exactly equal to m, based on 牛可乐's definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串是一个编程问题，要求判断是否存在长度为n的字符串其可爱度恰好等于m，并输出符合条件的字符串。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串是一个编程竞赛题目，要求判断是否存在特定长度和可爱度的字符串，并输出符合条件的解。"&lt;SEP&gt;"字符串外串 is the programming problem where the goal is to determine if a string of length n exists with a cute degree of m."</data>
