    <node id="&quot;DRAGON'S BREATH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An event where Tokitsukaze uses her dragon's ability to defeat monsters in an 'X' shaped pattern across the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an attack ability that defeats monsters in an 'X'-shaped pattern on the grid, including the target cell and four diagonal directions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is an attack that defeats monsters in an 'X' shape pattern extending from a targeted coordinate (x,y) to four diagonal directions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is the attack skill that creates an 'X'-shaped flame pattern to destroy monsters in four diagonal directions from a target cell."&lt;SEP&gt;"The attack mechanism used by Tokitsukaze to defeat monsters, forming an 'X' shape on the grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon's Breath is the action of releasing flames in an 'X' shape to destroy monsters across a grid, affecting multiple cells."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411bbe91994001030c7a545311f4d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab3ebf5f1287dbbf9a2ec35fad95eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRID MAP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A grid map with n rows and m columns where each cell contains monsters, represented as a_{i,j} for monster counts."&lt;SEP&gt;"An n x m grid representing the map with cells containing monsters, where coordinates (i,j) denote specific cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"Grid Map is the n×m rectangular grid where each cell (i,j) contains a certain number of monsters, forming the battlefield for the attack."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Grid Map is an n x m grid where each cell (i,j) contains a_{i,j} monsters, serving as the battlefield for the 'Dragon's Breath' attack."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2d793d3b341bfc53e485a1d35351f539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89dd6bd1e7fef4152822627f117d0a69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-325b730cedcf46c053439807511ce0ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d177fa42f88e3250bf9921ff21987ec2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOKITSUKAZE&quot;">
